# Local agent tooling — intentionally not tracked.
# Spec Kit scaffolding is reinstalled per machine via `specify init`.
# `specs` is a symlink to ../specs/<repo>, so specs live outside this repo.
#
# .specify/memory/constitution.md is the exception: the gate needs the
# committed copy to check drift where CI can see it. .specify/scripts/ is
# the exception because a bare `.specify/` ignore prunes git's traversal
# entirely, silently defeating any negation nested inside it — .specify/*
# plus explicit negations is the only pattern that actually works.
.specify/*
!.specify/memory/
.specify/memory/*
!.specify/memory/constitution.md
!.specify/scripts/

.claude/
specs
